Mountains is the third zone in the [[Fight|Fight Screen]], featuring 27 unique enemies. Defeating Keymaster R at the end of the zone unlocks access to the next zone, [[The Mist]]. Clearing the Mountains also unlocks the [[Perks#Yellow Farming Perk Tree|Yellow Perk Tree]] and the third row of [[Ascension]] perks. 

Every monster in the Mountains has a 1/360 chance to drop a unique [[Cards|Card]], and have +40% chance afterwards to drop higher quality star cards.

